---
layout: layout.njk
---

{% set elephantClass = "w-full h-auto" %}

<div class="bg-base-100 text-base-content min-h-screen">
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <div class="mb-8 flex justify-center gap-6 md:gap-10">
        <div class="w-24 text-pink-400 md:w-26">
          {% include "elephant.njk" %}
        </div>

        <div class="w-24 text-yellow-400 md:w-26">
          {% include "elephant.njk" %}
        </div>

        <div class="w-24 text-gray-400 md:w-26">
          {% include "elephant.njk" %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl leading-tight font-semibold md:text-5xl">
        There are elephants <br />in every meeting room.
      </h1>
      <p class="mb-3 text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-80">
        The brains in the room. The bureaucracy they work within. The culture
        they create together.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-80">
        Every organizational problem is shaped by all three.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THREE ELEPHANTS DETAILED -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-brain text-2xl text-pink-400"></i>
          <h2 class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold">
            The brains in the room
          </h2>
          <ul class="space-y-1 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
            <li>Habits and mental shortcuts</li>
            <li>Cognitive load</li>
            <li>Energy-efficient thinking</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-users text-2xl text-yellow-300"></i>
          <h2 class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold">
            The culture they create together
          </h2>
          <ul class="space-y-1 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
            <li>Trust</li>
            <li>Psychological safety</li>
            <li>Unwritten rules</li>
            <li>Shared assumptions</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines text-2xl text-gray-300"></i>
          <h2 class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold">
            The bureaucracy the work within
          </h2>
          <ul class="space-y-1 leading-relaxed opacity-90">
            <li>Rules and processes</li>
            <li>Decision rights</li>
            <li>Incentives</li>
            <li>Organizational structures</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONSULTING -->
  <section class="bg-accent py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-semibold">
        Organizations often misdiagnose their problems.
      </h2>
      <div class="mb-10 grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-90">
            A culture initiative tries to solve a bureaucratic constraint.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-90">
            A new process attempts to fix a cognitive overload problem.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-90">
            My role is to identify which elephant is actually driving the
            situation — and how the others reinforce it.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-4">
            <a
              href="/consulting/"
              class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline"
              >More about my approach →</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img
            src="/assets/images/GraphicRecording.jpeg"
            alt="Graphic recording session"
            class="w-full rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-sm"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROOF -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <blockquote class="border-primary mx-auto max-w-2xl border-l-4 pl-6">
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed italic opacity-90">
          Man merkt, dass Nicolas über langjährige Erfahrung im Team-Coaching
          verfügt. Dadurch war er in der Lage in kurzer Zeit ein sehr gutes
          Gefühl für die relevanten Themen zu bekommen, an welchen für die
          Weiterentwicklung unseres neu formierten Teams gearbeitet werden
          musste.
        </p>
        <footer class="mt-2 text-sm opacity-60">— André, Führungskraft</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FREE RESOURCES -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-center text-3xl font-semibold">
        Most challenges don't need consulting.
      </h2>
      <p
        class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-xl text-center text-lg leading-relaxed opacity-80"
      >
        You are the expert for your challenges. These resources help you
        explore, discuss, and improve your organization on your own terms.
      </p>
      <div class="text-center">
        <a
          href="/resources/"
          class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline"
        >
          To the resources →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "footer.njk" %}
</div>
